#: scenario5:scenario5_231177F8_A960_411F_BAD4_D4A6BF6A7379
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb90ffc1db2d2c03f96960bfdc5279f5257836fc442ccfa54137b72c3070bafd
