#: scenario5:scenario5_384DD30F_A1C3_4A73_BFCF_B7E3DFACBC6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6bff5d27fa594a21480a76a92930ab6b823000477c5dbff9ea64950f3a8e672b
