#: scenario5:scenario5_0CB33A79_4C6F_4949_B116_CA3F9D4681BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc1630551b533712c0fc81f9f2b92e1587772f71c2a2b9ecd803e46d0656940f
